    abstract = {This brief commentary describes some of the less discussed implications of generative artificial intelligence (GenAI) for changes in government communications, citizen experiences and the very foundations of government. It focuses on the current and developing capabilities of artificial intelligence to handle and generate text and images in a way that seems virtually human.},
