    abstract = {It is our pleasure to welcome you to the 19th edition  of the Dynamic Language Symposium (DLS 2023),  co-located with SPLASH 2023 in Cascais, Portugal.  After about two decades of dynamic language research and DLS, it is time to reflect  and look forward to what the next two decades will bring. This year’s DLS is  therefore a special one focusing on the Future of Dynamic Languages. To do  the notion of symposium justice, we invited speakers to present  their opinions on where dynamic languages might be, will be, or should be  in the next twenty years.},
